+++2. Select the budget mode: choose Set Token Cap (`cap-mode-enforce-btn`) with monthly period and an integer token allowance or preset (`1M`, `5M`, `25M`, `100M Tokens`); choose Unlimited Quota (`cap-mode-unlimited-btn`) for an internal cap of `10_000_000_000` tokens; or choose Hard AI Freeze (`preset-budget-0-freeze-btn`) to set monthly cap to `0`, immediately blocking all completion and agent transition requests with `BudgetExceeded` (Sparkle FIM completions return status `budget`).
